@startuml
title Use Case 2.3.1: Shelter Batch Upload
actor ShelterMember
participant ShelterBatch.vue
participant animals.ts
participant animals.py
participant animal_service.py
participant jobs.py
participant job_service.py
database MySQL

ShelterMember -> ShelterBatch.vue: Upload Excel file
ShelterBatch.vue -> ShelterBatch.vue: Validate file format
ShelterBatch.vue -> animals.ts: uploadBatchAnimals(file)
animals.ts -> animals.py: POST /animals/batch
animals.py -> job_service.py: create_batch_job()
job_service.py -> MySQL: INSERT INTO jobs
MySQL --> job_service.py: job_id
job_service.py --> animals.py: job
animals.py --> animals.ts: 202 Accepted
animals.ts --> ShelterBatch.vue: job_id
ShelterBatch.vue --> ShelterMember: Processing started

== Background Processing ==
job_service.py -> animal_service.py: process_batch()
loop Each row
  animal_service.py -> MySQL: INSERT animal
end
animal_service.py -> MySQL: UPDATE job SET status=COMPLETED
@enduml